{% extends 'layout/frontend.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <div class="container bg-white pl-25 pr-25">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <h1 class="page-header">
                        <span class='page-header-title'>PRODUCT CHALLENGE</span>
                </h1>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row pb-20">
            <div class="col-md-9 mb-60">
                <div class="border12 center-block">
                    <img src="{{ asset('images/Product_Challenge_Cover.jpg') }}" class="img-responsive" alt="" />
                </div>

                <h3 class="champion_head">2019 PRODUCT CHALLENGE EVENTS</h3>

                <p>Over the course of July and August, Nissan conducted the annual Product Challenge events across all states. 
                    Dealership teams came together for a night to celebrate and recognize individual and dealership achievements and of course test their Nissan product knowledge.  
                    The events were very well attended, with many new attendance records broken under the new {{ configuration('PROGRAM_SHORT_NAME') }} program.</p>

                <p>Each state’s event winning team was a contender for the Elite Product Challenge National Masters.  
                    The final results leader board is as follows, 
                    and Nissan would like to congratulate Ferntree Gully Nissan on their achievement of “National Masters” along with all other state winners. </p>

                <p>&nbsp;</p>
                <table class="table table-bordered text-center">
                    <thead>
                        <tr style="background: #4169E1; color: #ffffff;">
                            <td>National Masters Place</td>
                            <td>Winning State Event Dealership</td>
                            <td>Event Location</td>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>1st</td>
                            <td>Ferntree Gully Nissan</td>
                            <td>Melbourne</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>2nd</td>
                            <td>Clarkson Nissan</td>
                            <td>Western & Central - WA</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle;">3rd</td>
                            <td>von Bibra Gold Coast Nissan</td>
                            <td>Brisbane</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Pennant Hills Nissan</td>
                            <td>Sydney</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle;">5th</td>
                            <td>Main North Nissan</td>
                            <td>Western & Central - SA</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Parry NQ Nissan</td>
                            <td>Townsville</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>7th</td>
                            <td>Motors Nissan Launceston</td>
                            <td>Launceston</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <p>&nbsp;</p>
                <p>The {{ configuration('PROGRAM_SHORT_NAME') }} program is designed to reward high achievement and loyalty to the Nissan brand and will continue to bring you engaging and relevant incentives and reward programs.  
                    Get your staff involved and make sure you and your staff register in the {{ configuration('PROGRAM_SHORT_NAME') }} program.</p>

                <p>&nbsp;</p>
                <h3 class="champion_head">Congratulations goes to all regions with Winners and Runner up teams shown below – well done all!</h3>
                <table width=100%>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Adelaide</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner – <b>Main North Nissan</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up - <b>Jarrett Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Perth </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner – <b>Clarkson Nissan</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up - <b>Rockingham Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Brisbane</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner – <b>von Bibra Gold Coast Nissan</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up – <b>Ipswich Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Townsville</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner - <b>Parry Nissan</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up - <b>North Jacklin Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Sydney</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner – <b>Pennant Hills Nissan</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up – <b>Brookvale Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Launceston</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner – <b>Motors Nissan Launceston</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up – <b>Hobart Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2" class="tb-champion_area">Melbourne</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Winner – <b>Ferntree Gully Nissan</b></td>
                        <td>Runner up – <b>Brighton Nissan</b></td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

            </div>


